  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A racemate comprising equimolar amounts of dexverapamil and (<i>S</i>)-verapamil. An L-type calcium channel blocker of the phenylalkylamine class, it is used (particularly as the hydrochloride salt) in the treatment of hypertension, angina pectoris and cardiac arrhythmia, and as a preventive medication for migraine."
  ],
